<title>SWITZERLAND: Ares-Serono details Q1 1997 results.</title>
<headline>Ares-Serono details Q1 1997 results.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan 1 to Mar 31, 1997</p>
<p>				    (million dollars unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net			16.45	     vs 8.66</p>
<p> Net sales			211.99	    vs 175.75</p>
<p> Operating income	     35.54	     vs 22.76</p>
<p> R&amp;D spending		   38.08	     vs 31.30</p>
<p> Pre-tax before minorities  22.85	     vs 13.73</p>
<p> Earnings per share(dollar/shr)4.39		vs 2.31</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Ares-Serono SA SA. Data per share are based on assumption of 2,645,285 bearer shares and 2,753,260 registered shares outstanding in the periods.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
